1
00:00:22,039 --> 00:00:22,719
Lian Ye.

2
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:24,199
I'm fine.

3
00:00:38,759 --> 00:00:39,479
Mingyuan!

4
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:40,479
What happened?

5
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:41,560
He's been shot.

6
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:42,200
Over here.

7
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,000
Thank goodness.

8
00:00:47,079 --> 00:00:48,399
The bullet is three centimeters from his heart.

9
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:49,600
He almost didn't make it.

10
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,399
Quick, gauze!

11
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,200
This is just to keep him alive.

12
00:01:05,359 --> 00:01:06,200
To treat him properly,

13
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,879
we still need antibiotics and painkillers.

14
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,319
Lian Ye, hang in there!

15
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,760
We'll find a way.

16
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:30,719
We got some intel.

17
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:34,079
Tomorrow, the Japanese will move supplies

18
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:37,840
from Fuma Highway to downtown Rongcheng.

19
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:40,359
Besides medicine for the wounded,

20
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,280
there will be ammo and rations.

21
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:45,760
We plan to take a team to hijack it.

22
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:48,599
Along that route,

23
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:50,439
my officers and I intercepted contraband.

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,640
I'll go.

25
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:55,439
No way. Since they're military supplies,

26
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:57,040
the Japanese will guard them heavily.

27
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,680
It's too dangerous. Absolutely not.

28
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:00,439
Captain Xu,

29
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:02,719
I can give everything I have to fund you,

30
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,400
but he's the only son in our Li family.

31
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,560
He can't be put in danger.

32
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,280
That's where I draw the line.

33
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:09,960
Dad,

34
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:12,240
Captain Xu needs to protect the shelter.

35
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,479
It's a huge responsibility.

36
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,919
He can't just leave.

37
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,000
Lian Ye is wounded,

38
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,000
hanging by a thread.

39
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:19,479
If I don't go now,

40
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,080
do I even deserve to be their comrade?

41
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:21,759
But...

42
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,240
But this...

43
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,280
Don't worry, I'll be fine.

44
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,319
Did you make contact?

45
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,680
The radio's transmitter is broken.

46
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,840
It can receive messages from Command,

47
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,120
but it can't send any out.

48
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,840
What should we do now?

49
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:34,400
Get in.

50
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:45,919
Major General, the Chinese hijacked our military supplies.

51
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,159
I failed in my duty.

52
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,840
Where are those Chinese hiding?

53
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:02,840
Th-They're like ghosts,

54
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:04,039
hiding in the mountains.

55
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:08,719
Send my orders: dispatch reinforcements.

56
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,360
Find them, no matter what.

57
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,759
Yes, Major General.

58
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:30,680
Why is he burning up?

59
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:32,800
Could his wound be infected?

60
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,319
If we don't get antibiotics soon,

61
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,480
I'm afraid he won't last much longer.

62
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,600
Got them!

63
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,680
The antibiotics and painkillers you wanted.

64
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,959
Great! He's saved!

65
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:52,480
We're all going to make it!

66
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,800
Command

67
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,439
hasn't heard from us in a while.

68
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:05,439
They sent instructions over the radio,

69
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,879
asking us to deliver intel on Rongcheng's

70
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,319
Japanese troop deployments

71
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,879
to Ximen Street.

72
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:13,720
They'll send someone to receive it,

73
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:17,000
so we can coordinate from the inside out

74
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:18,680
to encircle and eliminate Japanese forces,

75
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,279
and liberate the people of Rongcheng.

76
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,920
This is what the guerrillas scouted out—

77
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,560
the intel on Japanese troop deployments.

78
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,720
I called everyone together

79
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,040
mainly to discuss

80
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:34,519
how to deliver this intel to Ximen Street.

81
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,079
From the mountains to Ximen Street,

82
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,399
the route passes through main streets,

83
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:41,199
which are full of Japanese checkpoints.

84
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,519
Besides, we just hijacked

85
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,639
Japanese military supplies.

86
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:46,240
Every Chinese will be strictly searched.

87
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,040
A Chinese person can't pass,

88
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,720
but a Japanese person can.

89
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:53,360
If I pose as a Japanese officer's family,

90
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,199
claiming to visit the western suburbs,

91
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:56,680
no one will stop us.

92
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,720
That's a good plan.

93
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,680
It's too dangerous for her to go alone.

94
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:02,879
I'll go with her.

95
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:03,879
No way.

96
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:06,120
You just hijacked the Japanese supplies.

97
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,600
They're looking everywhere for you.

98
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,920
You're too conspicuous. It's a bad idea.

99
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:13,399
Let me take Dieyi.

100
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:15,000
I used to pull a rickshaw.

101
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,879
I should take her to Ximen Street.

102
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:19,240
But...

103
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:22,639
you're the only son left in your family.

104
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,519
Dieyi is an only child, too.

105
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,480
Mingyuan is his family's only son, too.

106
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,240
My situation is no different.

107
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,120
If anything happens to me,

108
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,279
please take care of my mother.

109
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:34,759
All right.

110
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,600
It's settled then.

111
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:40,879
Chen Min and Dali take the intel tomorrow.

112
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:42,600
They'll send someone to make contact.

113
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,199
Don't forget the secret signal.

114
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,680
Understood.

115
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,720
Don't move.

116
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,920
Your wound will tear open.

117
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:02,920
I'm fine.

118
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:05,240
I just want to sit up.

119
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,040
Careful.

120
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,600
Dieyi.

121
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,519
You can't go.

122
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,040
Wait until my wound heals...

123
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:27,800
I can do it.

124
00:07:29,639 --> 00:07:31,600
So many people die in Rongcheng every day.

125
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:33,279
The people can't wait another day.

126
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,839
In the entire refugee camp, besides you,

127
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,199
my Japanese is the best.

128
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,519
I can fool them.

129
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:40,160
No.

130
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,120
It's too dangerous.

131
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,199
Dali is coming with me.

132
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,639
He'll protect me.

133
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,879
Dali is still just a kid.

134
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,600
Don't worry.

135
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,240
I'll come back.

136
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,600
How does it look?

137
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,240
It fits well. It could pass for real.

138
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:31,399
I'm ready too.

139
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:33,120
Let's head out.

140
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:35,799
Dali...

141
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:37,840
Dali.

142
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,279
I made your favorite oyster omelet.

143
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,120
Take it for the road.

144
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,559
Come back soon.

145
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:49,600
I'm off, Mom.

146
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:55,879
Stay safe.

147
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,679
Halt! Routine inspection.

148
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,679
Anna Tanaka.

149
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,639
You are Colonel Tanaka's daughter.

150
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:36,879
You know my father?

151
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,360
Colonel Tanaka is our commander.

152
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,919
Greetings, Miss Tanaka.

153
00:09:42,759 --> 00:09:43,720
Hello.

154
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,000
Miss Tanaka,

155
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,639
why aren't you traveling by private car?

156
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,240
Chinese rickshaws are quite interesting.

157
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,960
Enjoy your outing, Miss Tanaka.

158
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:03,960
Let them through.

159
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,279
You, get over here!

160
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:18,440
Halt!

161
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,080
She's posing as Japanese!

162
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,200
She's an enemy agent!

163
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,080
Bastard!

164
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:25,240
She's only disguised as Tanaka!

165
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:27,039
Stop! Get out!

166
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:32,120
Leave me! Carry on with the mission!

167
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:35,559
Don't let her get away!

168
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:36,799
Stop right there!

169
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,200
Over there.
